# D Additional Experimental Results

## D.1 Experimental Setups

The subsection continues Section 5.1.

**Datasets.** We adopt three datasets in our experiments: (1) Alpaca (Taori et al., 2023), an instruction-following dataset generated using Self-Instruct (Wang et al., 2023) from OpenAI’s `text-davinci-003` model; (2) HumanEval (Chen et al., 2021), a test dataset containing Python code synthesis problems; and (3) GSM8K (Cobbe et al., 2021), a dataset of high-school math problems. We only use prompts of the datasets and do not use responses.
